1
00:05:33,333 --> 00:05:39,333
Desperate times call for. . .

2
00:11:06,666 --> 00:11:12,666
Desperate Measures is a action, drama, thriller
film directed by Barbet Schroeder.

3
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:46,000
San Francisco police officer Frank Connor is in a frantic search for a
compatible bone marrow donor for his gravely ill son.

4
00:22:13,333 --> 00:22:19,333
There's only one catch the potential donor is convicted multiple murderer Peter McCabe who sees a
trip to the hospital as the perfect opportunity to get what he wants most: freedom.

5
00:27:46,666 --> 00:27:52,666
With McCabe's escape, the entire hospital becomes a battleground and Connor must pursue and,
ironically, protect the deadly fugitive who is his son's only hope for survival.

6
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:26,000
Peter McCabe, played by Michael Keaton.

7
00:38:53,333 --> 00:38:59,333
Frank Conner, played by Andy Garcia.

8
00:44:26,666 --> 00:44:32,666
Captain Jeremiah Cassidy, played by Brian Cox.

9
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Dr. Samantha Hawkins, played by Marcia Gay Harden.

10
00:55:33,333 --> 00:55:39,333
Nate Oliver, played by Erik King.

11
01:01:06,666 --> 01:01:12,666
Vargas, played by Efrain Figueroa.

12
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
Desperate Measures is a 1998 American action thriller film starring Michael Keaton, Andy
García, Marcia Gay Harden and Brian Cox, directed by Barbet Schroeder.

13
01:12:13,333 --> 01:12:19,333
It was filmed in both the San Francisco Bay Area and downtown Pittsburgh with such landmarks as
the BNY Mellon Center, the Allegheny County Courthouse and the Oakland Bay Bridge.

14
01:17:46,666 --> 01:17:52,666
The film was released on January 30, 1998, and was
a critical and financial failure.

15
01:23:20,000 --> 01:23:26,000
However, Andy García won an ALMA Award for "Outstanding
Actor in a Feature Film in a Crossover Role".

16
01:28:53,333 --> 01:28:59,333
The film explores themes of chase, donation,
paranoia, terminal illness, leukemia.

17
01:34:26,666 --> 01:34:32,666
The tone is intense and emotional and mind_bending.
